{
  "_comment": [
    "Overlay applied on top of config.paper.json.example for RESEARCH runs only.",
    "Binance's trading API answers HTTP 451 ('Service unavailable from a restricted",
    "location') to both this project's cloud sandbox and GitHub-hosted runners, so",
    "Freqtrade cannot load markets from api.binance.com there. Binance serves the",
    "same public spot market data from data-api.binance.vision, which carries no",
    "eligibility check. This overlay points ccxt's public endpoint at that mirror",
    "and limits market loading to spot, so backtesting can run offline-ish against",
    "already-downloaded candles.",
    "It changes NOTHING about safety: dry_run stays true, the exchange key and",
    "secret stay empty, and no order-placing command is ever issued."
  ],
  "exchange": {
    "skip_pair_validation": true,
    "ccxt_config": {
      "options": {
        "fetchMarkets": ["spot"]
      },
      "urls": {
        "api": {
          "public": "https://data-api.binance.vision/api/v3"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
